🔔 Widgets

২২. Badge Widget (2×2)

· শুধু badge image
· no_badge / badge_1-365 / max_badge
· Auto-update per streak

২৩. Iron Will Widget

· Badge + Progress %
· Days + STREAK label
· Protection ON/OFF
· ACTIVE/INACTIVE
· Click to open

২৪. Mission Widget

· Badge + Days + ON status
· Next Mission progress
· 2:1 aspect ratio
· Mosque background (widget_bg.png)

সব widget ৬ ঘন্টায় একবার auto-update (battery efficient)

---

📊 Logs & Storage

২৫. Logs System

· Safe + Blocked events
· 3-day auto-cleanup
· External storage: /sdcard/Islamic Guard/logs/
· Images: 120px JPEG 40% quality (~15-20 KB each)
· Index: JSON format
· Uninstall করলেও থাকে
· Auto-cleanup every 6 hours

২৬. Debug Log

· In-app viewer (About long press)
· Memory-based (500 lines max)
· Copy/Share buttons
· API tags: SVC, GUARD, SEARCH, URL, ORCH, FILTER

