📋 Technical Specs

· Minimum SDK: Android 8.0 (API 26)
· Target SDK: Android 15 (API 35)
· APK Size: ~45 MB (blocklist সহ)
· RAM Usage: 80-120 MB
· Battery: 2-4% / hour active use
· Supported Brands: Samsung, Xiaomi, Oppo, Realme, Vivo, OnePlus, Infinix, Tecno, itel, Huawei, Honor, Pixel, Motorola, Nokia, Asus, Lenovo

